  30:../src/middleware/bacnet/demo/handler/s_get_alarm_sum.c ****  * @section DESCRIPTION
  31:../src/middleware/bacnet/demo/handler/s_get_alarm_sum.c ****  *
  32:../src/middleware/bacnet/demo/handler/s_get_alarm_sum.c ****  * The Get Alarm Summary Request is used by a client BACnet-user to
  33:../src/middleware/bacnet/demo/handler/s_get_alarm_sum.c ****  * obtain a summary of "active alarms." The term "active alarm" refers to
  34:../src/middleware/bacnet/demo/handler/s_get_alarm_sum.c ****  * BACnet standard objects that have an Event_State property whose value is
  35:../src/middleware/bacnet/demo/handler/s_get_alarm_sum.c ****  * not equal to NORMAL and a Notify_Type property whose value is ALARM.
  36:../src/middleware/bacnet/demo/handler/s_get_alarm_sum.c ****  */
